              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Associated with California Polytechnic State University-San Luis Obispo"
                },
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Through a human-centered design process, a small team and I designed a vertical hydroponic system utilizing recycled products. We developed a business plan that identified target users, discussed potential sources of funding, and outlined a go–to–market strategy. We also built a functional prototype using several two-liter bottles and a water pump. The project culminated in a faculty-facilitated competition-style tradeshow in which our team took third place."
