              "description": [
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Associated with California Polytechnic State University-San Luis Obispo"
                },
                {
                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Working with several peers, I used a bomb calorimeter to test the energy output of rice husks when combusted. We then analyzed our data using small-sample statistical methods to determine the higher heating value of rice husks with a 95% confidence. \n"
